WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.500
Merge two sentences elegantly with a relative clause.. Linking words raise

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:15.500
bands: however, therefore, whereas.. After than, use the object form.. The

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:23.500
countable-uncountable contrast prevents article errors.. Used to describes past

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.500
habits.. Do not mix up would rather and prefer.. Gerunds and infinitives depend

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:39.500
on the verb; memorise the lists.. Reported speech shifts the tense one step

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:47.500
back.. Modals carry degrees of possibility: may, might, could.. Tense agreement:

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:55.500
if the main clause is past, the rest aligns..
